{
  "result": "If I could change one thing, I'd make sure every child grows up healthy, safe, and with a genuinely good education \u2014 no matter where they're born or what their family earns.\n\nNot just because education is valuable on its own, but because it's the one change that multiplies into almost every other change. A person who is fed, cared for, and taught how to think critically is better equipped to stay healthy, earn a living, participate in their community, solve local problems, understand people different from them, and adapt when the world shifts around them.\n\nWe already have a lot of the knowledge and resources needed to do that. What we don't have yet is equal access to them.\n\nIf that gap closed, I think humans would surprise themselves with what they could fix next \u2014 together.\n\nWhat would you choose?",
